WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.520
long lines in downtown Oakland Kamala
Harris drew a big crowd here for her

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:11.130
campaign kickoff rally among them many
young women like Island Portugal eager

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:17.520
to hear what the senator has to say we
really love how strong she is in like

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:24.480
criminal justice reform immigration
she just doesn't allow people to bully

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:29.160
her like she asked the hard questions
she keeps her composure she's really

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:34.829
well-spoken I am excited to see her
share her platforms and speak about what

00:00:34.829 --> 00:00:40.440
matters and ultimately be reinvigorated
by her yeah this rally was supposed to

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:45.270
be a show of political force and it
certainly looked that way when Kamala

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:50.550
Harris took to the stage the daughter of
Jamaican and Indian immigrants promised

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:55.110
to be a fighter for the people stating
that it was time to restore what she

00:00:55.110 --> 00:01:00.390
views as the loss of American values
under President Trump we are here

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:05.970
because the American Dream and our
American democracy are under attack and

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:13.320
on the line like never before and we are
here at this moment in time because we

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:24.450
must answer a fundamental question who
are we who are we as Americans let's

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:33.720
answer that question America we are
better than this the Democratic Party is

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:38.520
looking for fresh faces and Kamala
Harris who's been a US Senator for only

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:43.649
two years certainly fits that bill she
grew up here in Oakland a diverse

00:01:43.649 --> 00:01:48.780
industrial city known for its toughness
high crime rates and political left-wing

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:54.479
activism now she is the first female
black candidate having a viable shot at

00:01:54.479 --> 00:02:02.399
the presidency but with dozens of
Democrats lining up to run in 2020 the

00:02:02.399 --> 00:02:07.079
crucial question will be whether the
party thinks Kamala Harris has a chance

00:02:07.079 --> 00:02:11.410
of beating Donald Trump her supporters
definitely think she does

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:15.430
she understands people she understand
the middle class she understand the

00:02:15.430 --> 00:02:20.800
needs of our country and she has morals
which we don't have right now with a

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:25.750
year and a half until the Democrats
picked her presidential nominee Kamala

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:30.910
Harris still has a long way to go but
her Oakland rally was beyond doubt a

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:33.750
good start

